#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: Confirm deployment and establish the immediate objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l001"
msgstr "РУК, развертывание подтверждено. Жилая башня Эшфолл, седьмой сектор."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: State the required mission sequence concisely.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l002"
msgstr "Восстановите электроэнергию в секторе, освободите попавшую в ловушку команду безопасности и доберитесь до транзитного канала."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Establish that VECTOR is active elsewhere in Ashfall District.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l001"
msgstr "ГРАЧЬ, ВЕКТОР. Я в двух кварталах к востоку. Тот же пожар, та же потеря связи."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Direct attention toward the drones without stopping the tutorial.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l002"
msgstr "Что-то направляет дронов к занятым этажам. Я прослежу это отсюда."

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Introduce the first contradiction in ROOK’s remembered history.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l001"
msgstr "Капитан?"

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Make the recognition specific without explaining it.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l002"
msgstr "Я видел, как ты умер на мосту Кестрел. Восемь лет назад."

#. Speaker: ROOK
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Keep ROOK controlled and focused on the rescue.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l003"
msgstr "У вас не тот солдат. Можете ли вы двигаться?"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Offer a plausible explanation while redirecting the mission.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l001"
msgstr "Неврологическое воздействие может привести к ложному распознаванию и проецированию идентичности."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Close the interruption and return the player to the objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l002"
msgstr "Обезопасьте выжившего и продолжайте путь."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Facility channel
#. Intent: M06 arrival; OPERATOR's final direct address before becoming unreachable.
#: missions/m06.md
msgid "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"
msgstr "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Facility channel
#. Intent: M09 Imprint Zero activation; machine-directed command, not an address to the crew.
#: missions/m09.md
